From: SuccinctPaul <paul@hust.edu.cn>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 08:38:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kv-cache): sync int8/kivi_int4, add cache sizing, fix
 __post_init__ chain

Address reviewer feedback on PR #181:
- Sync int8/kivi_int4 into is_quantized_kv_cache and get_kv_quant_mode
- Integrate INT4/FP4_E2M1 packed cache sizing in AttentionSpec,
  FullAttentionSpec, MLAAttentionSpec, and SlidingWindowSpec
- Add backend capability fail-closed validation for head_size constraints
- Fix __post_init__ chain: FullAttentionSpec, SlidingWindowSpec, and
  SlidingWindowMLASpec now call super().__post_init__() so validation runs
- Fix KiVi double-count: AttentionSpec.real_page_size_bytes used 2x
  multiplier on asymmetric K (int4) + V (int8) head_dim
- Add test coverage for KiVi cache sizing and FullAttentionSpec fail-closed

Co-authored-by: Claude
Signed-off-by: SuccinctPaul <paul@hust.edu.cn>
